sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Fund Admin
    participant TEN as Tenant Management Subsystem
    participant SOM as Sell Offer - Management
    participant BAL as Balance Crediting / Debiting Subsystem
    participant CMP as Compliance Gateway
    participant RT as Real-time Sync (SignalR)
    Note over Admin, RT: PHASE 1 - SUBMIT AND AUTHORIZE
    Note over Admin, RT: Every state change below is also emitted as an audit event to the Audit subsystem, asynchronously and off the trade path
    Admin ->> SOM: Create offer (pair, volume, supplier price, idempotency key)
    SOM ->> TEN: Authorize (user, role, tenant status)
    alt Not authorized or tenant not active
        TEN -->> SOM: Denied
        SOM -->> Admin: Rejected NOT_AUTHORIZED or TENANT_SUSPENDED
    else Authorized
        TEN -->> SOM: Allowed (tenantId)
        Note over Admin, RT: PHASE 2 - VALIDATION
        SOM ->> SOM: Validate input (pair permitted, volume and price within configured limits)
        SOM ->> SOM: Get reference price for the pair: Liquidity depth Order book
        SOM -->> SOM: Reference price
        SOM ->> CMP: Check supplier approved, pair permitted, size within limits
        CMP -->> SOM: Result
        alt Validation failed
            SOM -->> Admin: Rejected (INVALID_OFFER, PRICE_OFF_MARKET, INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE, NOT_ELIGIBLE, LIMIT_EXCEEDED)
        else Validation passed
            SOM ->> BAL: Assets Reservation Request - AssetReservationRequest with Debit record with status REQUESTED and expiration
            alt Reservation accepted
                BAL -->> SOM: Result(Asset reservation request id, expiration)
                Note over Admin, RT: PHASE 3 - PRICING AND PUBLISHING
                SOM ->> SOM: Create offer (offerId, pair, block, listed price, supplier, asset reservation id) with timeout, expiry with asset reservation expiration
                alt Offer creation failed
                    SOM -->> Admin: Rejected PUBLISH_FAILED
                else Offer Created
                    SOM -) BAL: Async CDC - update asset reservation status to EXECUTED, Debit record with status EXECUTED
                    BAL -) SOM: Async CDC - reservation complete, Debit done
                    SOM ->> SOM: Offer status Available_For_Buying
                    SOM -) RT: OfferStateChanged (Available, version)
                    RT -) Admin: Offer visible to traders viewing the pair
                    SOM -->> Admin: Offer published (offerId)
                end
            else
                SOM -->> Admin: Rejected ( INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE)
            end
        end
    end

    Note over SOM, BAL: Pre-Paid but expired - ledger entries are released by a timeout, so a crash cannot strand funds